AUDIT SOUND is a derivative work of SideDeck. Its audio engine is a fork of
SideDeck's C++ engine (native/engine), adapted to run headless on a server and
stream its mixed output (Option B architecture). All upstream copyrights and
licenses remain in force and are reproduced below.

