Dependencies added by AUDIT SOUND for the server/streaming backend
(to be integrated in later milestones; listed here for completeness)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Oboe — REMOVED (was SideDeck's Android audio I/O; not used by the server-side
  Option B build). The audio sink is replaced by a streaming sink.

LAME — libmp3lame (LGPL)
  MP3 encoding of the mixed stream (milestone D1). Dynamically linked.

libshout (LGPL)
  Icecast source client for publishing the MP3 stream (milestone D2).

FFmpeg — libavcodec / libavformat (LGPL)
  AAC / M4A decode on the server (milestone M2), replacing Android MediaCodec.
